<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RMBH says to make capitalisation award.</title>
<headline>RMBH says to make capitalisation award.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>RMB Holdings Ltd on Friday announced it would award new shares by way of a capitalisation of distributable reserves.</p>
<p>The financial-insurance group said shareholders would be entitled to decline to receive the capitalisation award and to renounce their new shares to The Rand Merchant Bank Trust for cash.</p>
<p>It said full details of the capitalisation share award would be announced in the interim results announcement on March 4.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
